was a critical bug because:\n1. The API receives the entire conversation history
in `request.messages`\n2. The agent\'s `run()` method expects a user input 
string and adds it to the message history\n3. Previously, the agent was being 
called with an empty string, so it didn\'t know what to respond to\n4. The 
agent\'s message history wasn\'t being set from the request\n\n**Changes 
